Z||000001||RossT||01-12-2000||03:27 AM||||I like the view from back the best.<P>I thought that the trunk lid vents were to let hot air out of the engine compartment, If<BR>you have over the roof scoops, doesn't that let cool air in?<P>Ross||||reg||1
Z||000002||Uaana||01-12-2000||04:30 AM||||I've never seen anyone else say anything on<BR>this, but you are correct the fiero was designed to pull air from below and out the<BR>vents. The over the roof scoops end up negating that beautiful engineering.<BR>As for myself I always thought the things looked kinda silly! check out the riceboy web page listed on here under funny stuff. I think they fall into that catagory.||||reg||13
